Architectural Strategy: AWS vs. Alibaba Cloud for West Africa
Factor	Amazon Web Services (AWS)	Alibaba Cloud	Strategic Impact on FingerMobile
Local Infrastructure	Active Local Zone in Lagos, Nigeria + Cape Town Region (af-south-1)	No physical West African presence; nearest is Dubai or Europe	AWS delivers <10ms latency over Nigerian telecom networks (MTN, Airtel, Glo, Starlink).
Data Sovereignty (NDPA 2023)	Citizen data physically stays in Lagos Edge/Local Zone	Must transit internationally	Meets strict Nigeria Data Protection Commission (NDPC) residency mandates.
Fintech Talent Pool	Standard across Nigerian unicorns (Flutterwave, Moniepoint, OPay)	Extremely limited local talent pool	Simplifies hiring AWS-certified cloud architects and DevOps engineers in Lagos.
Currency Billing	Native Nigerian Naira (NGN) invoicing supported	USD denominated	Eliminates FX volatility and monthly USD card limits.
